{
  "rationale": "The plant models the robot's perception and motion capabilities, separating sensor outcomes from motion commands. The specification binds sensor outcomes to safe, consistent wall-following actions, enforcing safety, recovery, and oscillation avoidance. Only one controllable is enabled per decision state, and all uncontrollables are total. Recovery from obstacle_front is always via a right turn, and wall reacquisition is prioritized. No new events are introduced.",
  "strategy": [
    "Separate plant automata for perception and motion to allow modular specification.",
    "Specification automaton encodes safe wall-following: forward when clear and wall on left, right turn on obstacle_front, left turn to reacquire wall, and strict recovery/commit semantics to avoid oscillation."
